  "published": "2026-11-14T01:34:05.7Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Release 1.1.1:\n- Performance & Size: Decoupled desktop engine dependencies and enabled Link-Time Optimization (LTO) dead code elimination, reducing native binary footprint by ~16%.\n- Native Engine: Introduced modular dynamic loader for native rendering components.\n\nRelease 1.1.0:\n- Feature: Automatic format resolution via magic byte inspection (DocumentFormat.Auto).\n- Security: Zero-trust defense intercepting disguised executables (PE, ELF, Mach-O, LNK, scripts, CHM).\n- Security: Path traversal protection, null-byte sanitization, and cryptographic unmanaged password zeroing.\n- Performance: Zero-allocation cached format pointers, zero-allocation ASCII sniffing, and zero-copy MemoryStream conversions.\n- Engine: Streamlined native CSS preprocessor and standards-compliant HTML5 DOCTYPE handling.",
